      "output": "# Key Dash: Look Parameters (three.js r128)\n\n**Status:** Not run in a browser. Unverified: rounded-key appearance, glow strength, shadow cost, frame rate.\n\n**1. Renderer and scene**\n- `antialias:true`, `setPixelRatio(min(dpr,2))`, `shadowMap.enabled=true`, `type=PCFSoftShadowMap`.\n- `outputEncoding=sRGBEncoding`, `toneMapping=ACESFilmicToneMapping`, `toneMappingExposure=1.1`.\n- `scene.fog=new THREE.Fog(0xffb3d9,40,160)`.\n- Camera: `PerspectiveCamera(60,w/h,0.1,300)` at (0,3.2,6), looking at (0,1.2,−8).\n- Beat pulse: `pulse=Math.exp(-6*((songTime%0.5)/0.5))`.\n\n**2. Road**\n- Keys are laid across the road, repeat every 1.6 m in z, recycle at z = 0…−160.\n- **White key:** rounded rectangle 6 m × 1.5 m (along z), corner radius 0.12, extruded 0.4. `ExtrudeGeometry` with bevel 0.05. Lay it flat with `geo.rotateX(-π/2)`. Material: `MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xf7f7fb,roughness:0.35})`.\n- **Black key:** 3.6 × 0.42 × 0.9, raised by 0.25, `color:0x15151f`, roughness 0.3.\n- **Beat:** set emissive to 0x7fdcff with `emissiveIntensity=0.8*pulse`, and shift `y-=0.08*pulse`. For the key nearest the runner, use 1.5× both.\n- **Gap:** leave the keys out for 3 m. Add a black plane at y = −0.5 and two edge strips with `MeshBasicMaterial(0xff3fa4)`.\n- **Bar:** `BoxGeometry(6,0.3,0.3)` at y = 1.1, `MeshBasicMaterial(0xffe14d)`. Add an additive glow sprite with scale 7 × 1.2.\n\n**3. Note gems**\n- `OctahedronGeometry(0.35)` at y = 1.8, every 4 m.\n- Material: `MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x8a5cff,emissive:0x8a5cff,emissiveIntensity:1.2})`.\n- Motion: `rotation.y+=2*dt`, plus a bob of `0.15*sin(3t)`.\n- Glow sprite: canvas radial gradient, `AdditiveBlending`, `depthWrite:false`, scale 1.4.\n\n**4. Girl (≈1.5 m tall)**\n\n| Part | Geometry | Colour |\n|---|---|---|\n| Torso | cylinder (0.28, 0.32, 0.55) | hoodie 0xffd23f |\n| Hood | half sphere 0.3 | 0xffd23f |\n| Head | sphere 0.24 | skin 0xffd1b3 |\n| Skirt | cone (0.38, 0.3) | 0x1a1a1a |\n| Ponytail | sphere 0.12 + cylinder | hair 0x5a3420 |\n| Headphones | torus (0.26, 0.04) + two cylinders | 0xff3fa4 |\n| Trainers | box (0.14, 0.1, 0.26) | 0xffffff |\n\n- Limbs are pivoted upper and lower segments.\n- **Run:** `ω=4π` rad/s. Thigh `0.7 sin`, knee `0.9 max(0, −sin)`, arm `−0.8 sin`, elbow −1.2. Bounce `0.06|sin|`.\n- **Jump:** thighs −1.0, knees 1.4, arms −2.4.\n- **Slide:** body tilted back (`rotation.x=−1.1`), y = −0.45, legs forward at −1.4.\n\n**5. City**\n- Every 12 m on each side at x = ±(10…22).\n- Each tower: 3–6 stacked cylinders, radius 1.5–3, height 4–10 each, total height 15–45, colours from the palette.\n- Ring balconies: `TorusGeometry(r+0.2,0.12)` on every segment.\n- Windows: a CanvasTexture used as `emissiveMap`, `emissiveIntensity=0.6+0.4*pulse`.\n- Clouds: 5–8 merged white spheres with opacity 0.9, at y = 25–40.\n\n**6. Confetti**\n- `Points` of 600 particles, size 0.12, `vertexColors` from the palette.\n- Each particle falls 1.5 m/s and drifts sideways by `sin`.\n\n**7. Lighting and grading**\n- `HemisphereLight(0xbfe8ff,0xffc2e0,0.9)`.\n- `DirectionalLight(0xfff2d6,1.2)` at (5,12,6), `castShadow`, `mapSize 2048`, `shadow.camera` spanning ±12.\n- Background lerps 0x6ec8ff → 0xa98bff by pulse; fog colour follows it.\n\n**8. HUD (CSS)**\n- **Perfect** in 0x7fffd4, **Good** in 0xffe14d, **Miss** in 0xff4d6d.\n- Each word: scale 1.6 → 1 over 0.15 s, rises 30 px, fades out over 0.6 s.\n- Combo bounces to scale 1.3 on increment and shakes on Miss.\n\n**Palette:** 0xffd23f, 0xff3fa4, 0x7fdcff, 0x8a5cff, 0x6ec8ff, 0x3df5a7, 0xf7f7fb, 0x15151f"
